cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Kosaka Skin-o-hedron Model (KSF): A Layered-Complex Substrate for Discrete Operators on Curved Domains"
message: >-
  If you use this software or the mathematical framework it implements,
  please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kosaka
    given-names: Shin-Ichiro
    alias: ghostinkoma
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/ghostinkoma/Skinohedron-MCF-GarbageMesh-Challenge
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and full numerical verification of the Kosaka
  Skin-o-hedron Model (KSF): a layered polyhedral-complex substrate for
  discrete differential operators on 2-manifolds, with a 3D S-parameter
  extension. Includes per-section Python verification scripts, a WebGL
  interactive viewer, and a peer-review-ready LaTeX manuscript.
keywords:
  - discrete exterior calculus
  - Laplace-Beltrami operator
  - mesh quality
  - finite elements
  - S-parameters
  - numerical analysis
  - differential geometry
  - no free lunch theorem
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-06-16"
version: "2.0.0"
